      "title": "Measurement",
      "body": "Qst_C2H6 (C2H6) = 32.74 K at 1.013 bar"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "discrete cages with dimensions 4.1 Å × 4.3 Å → uptake"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "restricted pore size and low pore volume → uptake"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] change the synthesis solvent system to control MOF topology → solvent alternation enabled fine control of topology for efficient gas separation; H2O/EtOH produced Zn-mfa-atz-rob, while DMF/MeOH/H2O produced Zn-mfa-atz-pcu"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] use Zn-mfa-atz-pcu for one-step purification from quaternary CO2/C2H2/C2H6/C2H4 mixtures → the framework showed potential for one-step C2H4 purification from CO2/C2H2/C2H6/C2H4 mixtures"
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparison",
      "body": "Zn-mfa-atz-pcu vs Zn-mfa-atz-rob: winner=subject_a on pore_volume_and_gas_adsorption_capacity"
    }
  ],
