  "notable_quotes": [
    "H2O/EtOH templates a 6-connected near-porous rob network, while DMF-containing solvent shifts assembly to a porous 6-connected pcu network.",
    "Topology variation is presented as the dominant factor over pore chemistry, size, and geometry in controlling adsorption performance.",
    "The rob framework is less effective than the pcu analogue for one-step high-purity C2H4 production because it has lower pore volume and adsorption capacity."
  ],
